---
title: Milano Torino
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, aperitivo]
source: Classic cocktail, number 39 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #rocks glass{} with ice. Pour in @Campari{1.5%fl_oz} and @sweet vermouth{1.5%fl_oz}, stir, and garnish with an @orange{1%slice}.

> Campari from Milan, vermouth from Turin; the drink came before both the Americano and the Negroni.
